---
/**
 * Headshot slot: intentionally empty for now — no placeholder is rendered.
 * The slot is reserved at md+ so dropping an image in later does not reflow
 * the text column. To add one: import the asset and render it inside the
 * reserved div below, then drop the aria-hidden attribute.
 */
---

<header class="mb-16">
  <a href="/" class="font-mono text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-brand-mint mb-4 inline-block">&lt;- Return to root</a>

  <div class="md:grid md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_10rem] md:gap-10 md:items-start">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Maurice Moore</h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-gray-200 leading-relaxed">
        I help companies modernize the backend systems their revenue runs through — billing, payments, and the platforms underneath them. Eleven years at Google, most recently on Play's monetization platform.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hidden md:block w-40 h-40" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
</header>
